extract_result.scope:
a. This DR applies to all:
(1) Mission Areas, agencies, and staff offices who own, operate, manage, or control mainframes;
(2) Federal data in any medium or form that the USDA or those on behalf of the USDA generates, collects, provides, transmits, stores, maintains, or accesses;
(3) Systems or services, including cloud-based, that the USDA or those on behalf of the USDA use or operate. These include connections between or among data systems or services; and
(4) Facilities from which USDA systems operate whether the USDA or another entity on behalf of the USDA uses or operates them.
b. Nothing in this policy alters the need to protect national security systems or data.
